OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder after body found
OL,4,Ain bin
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 36-year-old accused of killing a man
OL,7,Fwhose body was found in a wheelie bin
OL,8,Fhas pleaded not guilty to murder.
OL,10,FMohamed Abotaka, 36, of Grand Parade,
OL,11,FPlymouth, appeared by video link from
OL,12,FExeter Prison, accused of murdering Ali
OL,13,FBarzai between 20 October and 21
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FBarzai, 52, was found in a service lane
OL,17,Foff Grand Parade in the West Hoe area
OL,18,Fof the city on 21 October.
OL,20,FThe case was adjourned for a pre-trial
OL,21,Freview until 16 April.
